    <status value="extensions"/><div xml:lang="en" lang="en"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class="res-header-id"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet mii-vs-icu-code-kontraindikation</b></p><a name="mii-vs-icu-code-kontraindikation"> </a><a name="hcmii-vs-icu-code-kontraindikation"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href="CodeSystem-mii-cs-icu-dgai.html"><code>https://www.medizininformatik-initiative.de/fhir/ext/modul-icu/CodeSystem/mii-cs-icu-dgai</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification"> version &#x1F4E6;2027.0.0</span><table class="none"><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href="CodeSystem-mii-cs-icu-dgai.html#mii-cs-icu-dgai-contraindication-enteral-nutrition">contraindication-enteral-nutrition</a></td><td style="color: #cccccc">Contraindication to enteral nutrition</td><td>Assessment of whether a contraindication to enteral nutrition is present or absent; the code itself does not assert its presence.</td></tr><tr><td><a href="CodeSystem-mii-cs-icu-dgai.html#mii-cs-icu-dgai-contraindication-proning">contraindication-proning</a></td><td style="color: #cccccc">Contraindication to prone positioning</td><td>Assessment of whether a contraindication to prone positioning is present or absent; the code itself does not assert its presence.</td></tr><tr><td><a href="CodeSystem-mii-cs-icu-dgai.html#mii-cs-icu-dgai-contraindication-drug-based-thrombosis-prophylaxis">contraindication-drug-based-thrombosis-prophylaxis</a></td><td style="color: #cccccc">Contraindication to pharmacological thromboprophylaxis</td><td>Assessment of whether a contraindication to pharmacological thromboprophylaxis is present or absent; the code itself does not assert its presence. Mechanical thromboprophylaxis is outside its scope.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>
